    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "1.双击【黑之记忆】，选“是”交出【黑之记忆】传送至黑之祭坛。",
      "type": "memory-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆【黑之记忆】获得方式参考《深渊》任务",
      "type": "item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "2.与龙的使者（16.25）对话，传送至光明与黑暗的祭坛。",
      "type": "teleport-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆持有【世界之心】与龙的使者（24.17）对话，选“是”获得【黑之记忆】并传送回召唤之间",
      "type": "memory-recovery",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "3.调查龙之像（59.70），选“是”获得【浑沌之魂】并传送之玄关。",
      "type": "soul-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆双击【浑沌之魂】，交出【浑沌之魂】并传送回玄关",
      "type": "soul-abandon",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "4.通过黄色传送石（18.39），进入询问之地。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◆询问之地为随机迷宫，共40层",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "迷宫刷新时间：4小时（仅供参考），地图大小范围：30*30~100*100",
      "type": "maze-metadata",
      "sourceLines": [
